{"id":"n51528-1-7","stage":2,"title":"마냥 · 一直","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51528-1-7-1","ko":"언제까지 민준이를 마냥 기다리기만 할 거야?","zh":"你打算一直这样无休止地等敏俊到什么时候？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이를","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"민준이를","audio":"/audio/5f6ad412fa56cdf3c242.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"마냥","meaning":"一直","explanation":"마냥：一直","readings":[{"term":"마냥","audio":"/audio/d2190ea517a326577d99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51528","senseId":"1","lemma":"마냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다리기만","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"d2190ea517a32657","term":"마냥","zh":"一直","audio":"/audio/d2190ea517a326577d99.mp3","entryId":"51528","definition":"不管到什么时候，始终如一地。","pronunciation":["마냥"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/223faf18d049ef7ea755.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n51528-1-7-2","ko":"알았어. 전화라도 해 볼게.","zh":"知道了，我至少会试着给他打个电话的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알았어.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전화라도","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼게.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈；或指通过那样传达的内容。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/52a274869bddc9004946.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.433,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=51528","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":78,"sequenceScore":2.1583,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["知道了，我至少会试着给他打个电话的。","你打算一直这样无休止地等敏俊到什么时候？","今天科学课在哪里上？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你打算一直这样无休止地等敏俊到什么时候？","今天科学课在哪里上？","知道了，我至少会试着给他打个电话的。"],"answer":2}]}
